	<key>readme</key>
	<string>Type aff, then part of a product, brand, section, promo, or URL.

Return copies the whole line: emoji, product name, and link.
⌘Return copies the URL alone.
⌥Return copies the UK line (emoji, name, and UK link) when there is one.
⌃Return copies the promo note when there is one.

Alt URLs and UK links are their own rows. Return on those rows copies emoji, name, and that row's link.
Lines under Notes to Clean Later show up when they match, and they are not copied.

The links file is workflow configuration "Links file". It defaults to the Google Drive copy so every synced Mac reads the same list.

Source: https://github.com/stevencombs/alfred-affiliate-links</string>
